\f1\i 	//5.1.1 you have a page with all the products that are listed 	//	from the print shops. (If clicked on BROWSEALL)\

\f0\i0 	5.1.2. You click one product from \'93the create a 	product\'94 section (where products from print shops are 	listed)in the dashboard page and you are lead 	to the product details page where you can choose the 	product characteristics.\
	5.2. Product details page_1 - you can see: color, sizes,\
	materials, print options - you can see pictures and 	description for the product (given by the printshop) .\
\
	- here you can choose \'93Design now\'94(5.2.1) or \'93Hire a 	designer\'94(5.2.2).\
\
		5.2.1.1. \'93Design now\'94 page where you can design your 		chosen product.\
			- you can choose to upload a photo or use ai. You can 			see recent uploads as well/ designs.\
			-When a picture is uploaded, you can see the preview 			immediately on the chosen product pictures. You can 			place your picture on the product itself. Price will be 			calculated on top of the previous price which depends on the 			photo colors/resolution. Choose a product color as well 			(additionally in the pdp_2). 			After clicking \'93next\'94 you go to product details 			page_2(5.2.2) .\
		5.2.1.2.Product details 	page_2 is the page where you 		CHOOSE specific things about the product from Product 		details page_1. Namely , you can choose: sizes , additional 		colors (even though they are chosen in 5.2.1), material, 		print type. APART from the printer-specific stuff you can 		choose, you can choose product name, description and price as 		well. You can see how much you will earn depending on 		what price you put. (Add ai competition for name & 		description as well). Click next to go to another page 		(5.2.1.3) Offer design on more products page - you can see 		already chosen top 3 products where you can see your 		design on them OR you can choose more products on 		which your design will be put on.\
		If you click more products you go to (5.2.1.2) for EVERY 		EACH NEW PRODUCT.\
		You will have two buttons, to add the new product(s) as 		listed(publish them as well) or unlisted products.\
		\
		(5.2.2.1) Hire a designer page - a page where you can 		create your job offer post.\
		What you can see here is:\
		- product details on the side about the chosen product.\
		- you can edit:\
			- offer title\
			- offer description\
			- payment option (fixed, % or both)\
			- image for reference \
			- deadline\
			- publish date approx.\
			- ?other stuff?\
		- click create and you are redirected to the MY JOB 		OFFERS PAGE (6).\
